Faku (fx + Waku) is a GPL-3.0-only desktop inspired by Waku
(https://github.com/egoist/waku) by egoist. It is not a copy of Waku's
Rust or TypeScript sources.

This software uses the Vercel Native SDK (https://github.com/vercel-labs/native),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

First-party provider support targets Tianyi's fx fork
(https://github.com/keejkrej/fx), a fork of Vercel fx, also
Apache-2.0. This tree does not vend fx. Install from that repo's
GitHub Releases, not https://fx.sh.

